/-- exact: `KeyParameterValue::get_tag` returns the tag that the `tag = ...` attribute of the
variant gives (`tagOf`), whatever the payload is. Of the 63 tags, 61 are constants of the
translation, so the result is that constant (it can itself fail); `ALGORITHM` and `EC_CURVE` are
`ok` of a number. -/
theorem key_parameter_value_get_tag (v : KeyParameterValue) :
    valueGetTag v = tagOf v := by
  sorry

/-- exact: for the `Algorithm` variant `get_tag` returns the tag number `0x10000002` (`268435458`),
for every payload. -/
theorem key_parameter_value_get_tag_algorithm (a : Algorithm.Algorithm) :
    valueGetTag (KeyParameterValue.Algorithm a) = ok 268435458#i32 := by
  sorry

/-- exact: for the `EcCurve` variant `get_tag` returns the tag number `0x1000000a` (`268435466`),
for every payload. -/
theorem key_parameter_value_get_tag_ec_curve (c : EcCurve.EcCurve) :
    valueGetTag (KeyParameterValue.EcCurve c) = ok 268435466#i32 := by
  sorry

